{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-14T11:45:12.527Z","data":{"text":"I completed the in-scope work for task 6 and wrote the result file.\n\n**What I built (all inside the task's `scope`):**\n\n- **`src/core/report/query-pauses.ts`** (new) — `PAUSE_TABLES` = `pauses(change, task, paused_at, until, source)`, plus `insertPauses(db, subjects)`. It walks each archived change's digit-named task streams in numeric order, reads them through `readEventStream`, and inserts one row per `paused` event (`change` = folder, `task`/`until`/`source` from the event's object `data`, `paused_at` = the event `timestamp`). No object `data` → no row; wrong-typed fields read as null. Tagged with the three pause scenarios and `@adr 008`.\n- **`src/core/report/query-tables.ts`** — `...PAUSE_TABLES` after `...TASK_OUTCOME_TABLES`, and `insertPauses` called in `build` after `insertLinkFindings`.\n- **`tests/query-command.test.ts`, `tests/query-trial-tables.test.ts`, `tests/query-tables.test.ts`** — only their pinned table lists gained the `pauses` line/entry after `task_outcomes`.\n- **`tests/query-pauses.test.ts`** (new) — proves \"Pauses of one archived change\", \"No pauses\", \"Pauses listed\" and the reworded \"Task outcomes listed\" through the real `osq query` command.\n\n**Verification:** the task verify passes, and the full suite is 4038/4039.\n\n**Why I report Blocked:** the one failure is `tests/query-task-outcomes.test.ts` (from archived change 186), which asserts the *old* wording — that `task_outcomes` is the last printed line. This change's own delta rewrites that scenario to \"directly after `link_findings`\" and puts `pauses` last, making the assertion obsolete. That file is outside this task's `scope`, so the rules forbid changing it; the task can't make `pnpm verify` pass within scope. The result file records this under `## Outside scope` and `## Blocked`, asking for the file to be added to task 6's scope (its `prints task_outcomes last` case reworded/dropped).\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/193-usage-limit-pause/.run/results/6.md`."}}
